msgstr ".. image:: images/forms/optionTypeHelp.png"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:72
msgid ""
"As an example, see the configuration for an Ubuntu server in the "
"expandable section below. You'll notice in the configuration that a "
"VMware Cloud, a specific Group, a specific Plan, and other static "
"configurations are set. Since the Group, Cloud, Plan and other variables "
"are able to be automatically injected, the user may select a different "
"Group, Cloud, Plan, etc. from the form at provision time. The creator of "
"the Catalog Item does not need to override those static configurations "
"with variable calls."
msgstr ""
"As un/una example, see el/la configuration para un/una Ubuntu server en "
"el/la expandable section below. You'll notice en el/la configuration "
"ese/esa un/una VMware Nube, un/una específico/específica Grupo, un/una "
"específico/específica Plan, y otro/otra static configurations son set. "
"Since el/la Grupo, Nube, Plan y otro/otra variables son able a be "
"automatically injected, el/la user puede/n select un/una diferente Grupo,"
" Nube, Plan, etc. desde el/la form en provision time. El/La creator de "
"el/la Catalog Item does ningún need a override esos/esas static "
"configurations con variable calls."

