#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:249
msgid "Building Catalog Blueprints"
msgstr "Building Catalog Blueprints"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:253
msgid ""
"|morpheus| Blueprints allow for full multi-tier application deployment. "
"In the Self Service catalog, user can create catalog items based on pre-"
"existing App Blueprints. If new Blueprints need to be created for the "
"Service Catalog, see other sections of |morpheus| docs on building App "
"Blueprints of various supported types. Just like with catalog Instances, "
"we can pre-configure Blueprints and present them to users viewing the "
"Service Catalog Persona view for easy, one-click deployment."
msgstr ""
"|morpheus| Blueprints allow para full multi-tier application deployment. "
"In el/la Self Service catalog, user puede/n create catalog items based en"
" pre-existing App Blueprints. Si nuevo/nueva Blueprints need a be "
"creado/creada para el/la Service Catalog, see otro/otra sections de "
"|morpheus| docs en building App Blueprints de various soportado/soportada"
" types. Just like con catalog Instancias, we puede/n pre-configure "
"Blueprints y present them a users viewing el/la Service Catalog Persona "
"view para easy, one-click deployment."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:255
msgid ""
"From the Catalog Items List Page (|LibBluCat|), click :guilabel:`ADD`. "
"From the dropdown menu, select Blueprint. The modal window will appear to"
" configure and add a new catalog Blueprint."
msgstr ""
"From el/la Catalog Items List Page (|LibBluCat|), click :guilabel:`ADD`. "
"From el/la dropdown menu, select Blueprint. El/La modal window será/n "
"appear a configure y add un/una nuevo/nueva catalog Blueprint."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:272
msgid ""
"**CONFIGURE:** Click :guilabel:`CONFIGURE` to use the familiar App "
"provisioning wizard to tie Blueprint and App deployment configuration to "
"the Catalog Item"
msgstr ""
"**CONFIGURE:** Click :guilabel:`CONFIGURE` to use the familiar App "
"provisioning wizard to tie Blueprint and App deployment configuration to "
"the Catalog Item"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:273
msgid ""
"**APP SPEC:** Inject App spec here for any fields required to provision "
"an App from your Blueprint. You may also inject any overrides to the "
"existing Blueprint spec that are desired. App Spec configuration must be "
"YAML, a simple example that names the App and sets the Group and Cloud is"
" included below:"
msgstr ""
"**APP SPEC:** Inject App spec here para cualquier fields "
"requerido/requerida a provision un/una App desde your Blueprint. You "
"puede/n también inject cualquier overrides a el/la existente Blueprint "
"spec ese/esa son desired. App Spec configuration debe/n be YAML, un/una "
"simple example ese/esa names el/la App y sets el/la Grupo y Nube es "
"included below:"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:275
msgid ""
"#Example App Spec\n"
"\n"
"name: '<%= customOption.appName %>'\n"
"group:\n"
"  name: Dev Group\n"
"environment: Dev\n"
"tiers:\n"
"  Web:\n"
"    instances:\n"
"      - instance:\n"
"          type: nginx\n"
"          cloud: Dev AWS\n"
"  App:\n"
"    instances:\n"
"      - instance:\n"
"          type: apache\n"
"          cloud: Dev AWS"
msgstr ""
"#Example App Spec\n"
"\n"
"name: '<%= customOption.appName %>'\n"
"group:\n"
"  name: Dev Grupo\n"
"environment: Dev\n"
"tiers:\n"
"  Web:\n"
"    instances:\n"
"      - instance:\n"
"          type: nginx\n"
"          cloud: Dev AWS\n"
"  App:\n"
"    instances:\n"
"      - instance:\n"
"          type: apache\n"
"          cloud: Dev AWS"

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:295
#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:331
msgid ""
"**CONTENT:** Optionally include documentation content for this Catalog "
"Item. Markdown-formatted text is accepted and displayed appropriately "
"when the item is ordered from the Service Catalog. A new Catalog Item-"
"type Wiki entry will also be added containing this information."
msgstr ""
"**CONTENT:** Optionally include documentation content para este/esta "
"Catalog Item. Markdown-formatted text es accepted y displayed "
"appropriately cuando el/la item es ordered desde el/la Service Catalog. "
"Un/Una nuevo/nueva Catalog Item-type Wiki entry será/n también be "
"agregado/agregada containing este/esta information."

#: ../../library/blueprints/self-service.rst:297
msgid ""
"App spec custom option variables should be single quoted in YAML: "
"``cloud: '<%= customOption.cloud %>'``. Additionally, not all variables "
"are available here as many are unknown until provisioning. Users may use "
"any custom Input values (customOption) as well as name or hostname values"
" which are resolved as part of naming policy evaluation."
msgstr ""
"App spec custom option variables debería/n be single quoted en YAML: "
"``cloud: '<%= customOption.cloud %>'``. Additionally, ningún todos/todas "
"variables son disponible here como muchos/muchas son unknown until "
"provisioning. Usuarios puede/n use cualquier custom Input values "
"(customOption) como well como name o hostname values el/la cual son "
"resolved como part de naming policy evaluation."

